OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWenn eine neue Firmware herauskommt,   
OL,4,Gkann jeder User hier das Changelog     
OL,5,Gposten.                                
OL,7,GChangelog zu Firmware 1.1.0            
OL,9,G** 1.1.0 (build 165) - March 16, 2026  
OL,10,G**                                     
OL,12,GAdded ----- - Navigation: Left arrow a 
OL,13,G(top-left of C64U keyboard) will now   
OL,14,Gnavigate back a menu, in addition to   
OL,15,Gprevious controls such as WASD. - USB  
OL,16,GMouse Support: Should support most     
OL,17,Gmice. (Some proprietary USB mice may   
OL,18,Gnot work.) - The LED controller for the
OL,19,Gkeyboard and case now has Music Detect 
OL,20,Gmode, which can automatically detect   
OL,21,Gsounds and start jamming to your       
OL,22,Gfavorite SIDs and game sound effects,  
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/3) 
